                    <div class="col-lg-9">
                      <div class="content">
                        <div id="LicensingContent" class="content-section">
                          <div class="row g-0 p-3">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2">
                              <p><b>OVERVIEW</b></p>
                              <p>Licensing is a critical component in the regulatory framework and serves a key function in the supervision value chain. It provides an entry point for applicants before they are allowed to conduct business as a financial institution. It is therefore essential that licensing systems be efficient and robust.</p>
                              <p>It is important to note that the principle of proportionality applies, to ensure that there is no “one-size-fits-all” licensing approach. The approach and the requirements must be proportionate to the risks underlying the business activities of different entities.</p>
                              <ul style="list-style-type: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
                                <li><a href='/Entity-Persons-Search/?iframe_target=financial-services-providers'>Check if a firm is authorised</a></li>
                                <li><a href='https://www2.fsca.co.za/CRM_Web_Extentions/enquiry.aspx' target="_blank">Submit an enquiry or complaint</a></li>
                                
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLicensing&subCollapse=subCollapseOneLicensing">Insurers and Microinsurers</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLicensing&subCollapse=subCollapseTwoLicensing">Financial Advisory and Intermediary Services</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLicensing&subCollapse=subCollapseThreeLicensing">Collective Investment Schemes and Hedge Funds</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLicensing&subCollapse=subCollapseFourLicensing">Retirement Funds</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLicensing&subCollapse=subCollapseFiveLicensing">Credit Rating Agencies</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLicensing&subCollapse=subCollapseSixLicensing">Capital Markets</a></li>
                              </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                              <div class="sidenav-image-container">
                                <img src="/Licensing and registration.jpg" alt="Licensing and registration" id="iqi3wg" name="Licensing and registration">
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="EServicesContent" class="content-section active">
                          <div class="row g-0 p-3">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2">
                              <p><b>OVERVIEW</b></p>
                              <p>In order to ensure efficient and effective mechanisms for compliance and supervision, various online portals are made available to industry and regulated entities.</p>
                              <ul style="list-style-type: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseEService&subCollapse=subCollapseOneEService">Insurers and Microinsurers</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseEService&subCollapse=subCollapseTwoEService">Financial Advisory and Intermediary Services</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseEService&subCollapse=subCollapseThreeEService">Collective Investment Schemes and Hedge Funds</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseEService&subCollapse=subCollapseFourEService">Retirement Funds</a></li>
                                <li><a href='https://www2.fsca.co.za/MagicScripts/mgrqispi.dll?APPNAME=Web&PRGNAME=FSB_Online_Logon&ARGUMENTS=-N7' target="_blank">Credit Rating Agencies</a></li>
                                <li><a href='https://www2.fsca.co.za/MagicScripts/mgrqispi.dll?APPNAME=Web&PRGNAME=FSB_Online_Logon&ARGUMENTS=-N27' target="_blank">Joint Standards Submission Portal</a></li>
                              </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                              <div class="sidenav-image-container">
                                <img src="/E-services.jpg" alt="E-services" id="iqi3wg" name="E-services">
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="LeviesContent" class="content-section">
                          <div class="row g-0 p-3">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2">
                              <p><b>OVERVIEW</b></p>
                              <p>The Financial Sector Conduct Authority, in terms of section 237(1)(a) of the Financial Sector Regulation Act, 2017 (Act No. 9 of 2017) and various sections under financial sector laws, hereby determines fees charged by the Financial Sector Conduct Authority, to the extent set out in the Schedule.</p>
                              <ul style="list-style-type: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLeviesFees&subCollapse=subCollapseOneLevies">FSCA Levies</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseLeviesFees&subCollapse=subCollapseTwoLevies">FSCA Fees</a></li>
                              </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                              <div class="sidenav-image-container">
                                <img src="/Levies and fees.jpg" alt="Levies and fees" id="iqi3wg" name="Levies and fees">
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="RegulatedEntitiesContent" class="content-section">
                          <div class="row g-0 p-3">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2">
                              <p><b>OVERVIEW</b></p>
                              <p>Summative lists are provided for all entities registered as authorised financial product providers. </p>
                              <p>Search and confirm the registration status of financial services providers.</p>
                              <ul style="list-style-type: none;  margin: 0; padding: 0;">
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseRegulated&subCollapse=subCollapseOneRegulated">Insurance</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseRegulated&subCollapse=subCollapseFiveRegulated">Financial Advisory and Intermediary Services</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseRegulated&subCollapse=subCollapseTwoRegulated">Collective Investment Schemes</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseRegulated&subCollapse=subCollapseThreeRegulated">Credit Rating Agencies</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseRegulated&subCollapse=subCollapseFourRegulated">Retirement Funds</a></li>
                              </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                              <div class="sidenav-image-container">
                                <img src="/List of regulated entities.jpg" alt="List of regulated entities" id="iqi3wg" name="List of regulated entities">
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="SupervisoryInformationContent" class="content-section">
                          <div class="row g-0 p-3">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2">
                              <p><b>OVERVIEW</b></p>
                              <p>Guidelines and documents outlining and unpacking information required for the registration and supervision of financial products, highlighting requirements.</p>
                              <ul style="list-style-type: none;  margin: 0; padding: 0;">
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseSupervisory&subCollapse=subCollapseOneSupervisory">Insurers and Microinsurers</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseSupervisory&subCollapse=subCollapseFiveSupervisory">Financial Advisory and Intermediary Services</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseSupervisory&subCollapse=subCollapseThreeSupervisory">Collective Investment Schemes and Hedge Funds</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseSupervisory&subCollapse=subCollapseSevenSupervisory">Retirement Funds</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseSupervisory&subCollapse=subCollapseTwoSupervisory">Credit Rating Agencies</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseSupervisory&subCollapse=subCollapseSixSupervisory">Capital Markets</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/Regulated-Entities?collapse=collapseSupervisory&subCollapse=subCollapseFourSupervisory">Friendly Society</a></li>
                              </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                              <div class="sidenav-image-container">
                                <img src="/Supervisory Information.jpg" alt="Supervisory Information" id="iqi3wg" name="Supervisory Information">
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="FSCAeLearningContent" class="content-section">
                          <div class="row g-0 p-3">
                            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-2">
                              <p><b>OVERVIEW</b></p>
                              <p>CPD is the ongoing learning and development that professionals undertake to maintain and improve their knowledge, skills, and competence.</p>
                              <p>The FSCA supports the industry in addressing any knowledge gaps related to the laws administered by the FSCA, consequently contributing to the skills of regulated persons.</p>
                              <a href="https://elearning.fsca.co.za" target="_blank">Login to FSCA e-learning</a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                              <div class="sidenav-image-container">
                                <img src="/FSCA elearning.jpg" alt="FSCA eLearning" id="iqi3wg" name="FSCA eLearning">
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
            </li>
