                this document, the user (including users resident outside the Republic of South Africa) accepts that the
                law of the Republic of South Africa shall apply.</p>
              <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-12"><a href="/Entity-Persons-Search?iframe_target=otc-derivative-providers" target="_blank" class="btn custom-btn">Accept and Continue</a></div>
